<p class="contact-subtitle">Have a question or want to work together? We'd love to hear from you.</p>

{%- comment -%} Parked until the consulting page is linked. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  <p class="contact-hint">
    For a consulting enquiry, the most useful first message tells us the languages, roughly how big the repo is, how long
    CI takes, and which agent and model you use.
  </p>
{%- endcomment -%}

<form class="contact-form" method="POST">
  <div class="form-group honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
    <label for="company_website">Company Website</label>
    <input type="text" id="company_website" name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="name">Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="email">Email</label>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="your@email.com">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="subject">Subject</label>
    <input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" required placeholder="What's this about?">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="message">Message</label>
    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="Tell us more..."></textarea>
  </div>

  <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send message</button>
</form>

<p class="direct-email">
  Prefer email? You can also reach us directly at <a href="mailto:hello@matto.club">hello@matto.club</a>
</p>
